O-Okay.

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:51.040
You really thought of everything, huh, Yuyu?

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:53.870
A Lily should be prepared.

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:57.290
Still, this is a first for us.

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:58.870
I suppose so.

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:02.500
