00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:03.080
--What a paradise.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:05.580
--Everywhere is Hell now!
--What a paradise.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.580
Doesn't the cool breeze feel nice?

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:13.160
Yeah, it reminds me of home.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.700
"Acting chairman"
"Takamatsu Kogetsu"

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:22.750
"Don't overload the outlet!"

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:29.580
This is the current state
of nest No. 7 in Yuigahama,

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:33.040
which we monitor here
at Yurigaoka Girls' Academy.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.330
I see?

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:39.500
Here you see the ultra-class Huge
thought to be the nest's ruler.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:41.950
Ultra what?

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:45.700
Umm, wait, could that be

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.370
at the bottom of the sea?

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.370
Yes! Yes, exactly!

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.830
Oh, and ultra-class Huge are said to be

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:55.250
anywhere from 400 meters to a kilometer long.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:58.620
I don't really get it, but that's a lot.

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:00.330
The Huge we've faced lately

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:06.500
have been drawing, practically stealing,
a lot of Magie from this ultra-class.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:10.660
Due to the excess load, the entire nest

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:14.870
now seems to have
practically ceased functioning.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:17.700
We'll never get a better chance to eliminate it.

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:19.870
E-Eliminate it?

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:26.660
And we wish to entrust you
with that mission, Hitotsuyanagi.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:27.700
Okay.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.080
Wait, me?!

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:51.450
But how do we...?

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:52.700
With this.

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:54.540
This is...

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:57.870
You're probably more familiar with it.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.620
This Dáinsleif

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:03.700
is the CHARM you could say
caused this whole situation.

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:06.290
The spells Miss Misuzu overwrote

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:10.250
circulated through the Yuigahama Huge
and made them go haywire.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.750
That gave me the idea.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:17.120
I loaded it with a "bug" spell
to bring down the ultra-class.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:21.000
But I never expected we'd be using it so soon,

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:24.660
so I had to improvise with what I had.

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:28.410
We need to hurry, then.

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:35.250
After today's battle, we only have
this handful of CHARMs left.

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:39.370
If a Huge appeared now,
there'd be nothing we could do.

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:45.290
This can only be used by a Lily with
at minimum the Rare Skill Charisma.

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:48.830
Anyone else won't be able to inject the bug,

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:51.790
and even risks being infected herself.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.830
So, umm...

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:57.040
In the end, what <i>is </i>Charisma, anyway?

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:02.330
The way you fought today goes
beyond the normal Charisma Skill.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:06.910
All Lilies displayed significantly
improved performance.

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:09.790
We ended up being part of it, too,

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:13.910
but the whole student body passing
one Magie sphere for the Neunwelt Tactic

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:16.370
would normally be impossible.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:21.500
This is just a theory, but you may even
have manifested a higher-level Skill.

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:26.910
Even so, it's still a dangerous mission.

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:28.250
Yes.

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:33.580
Umm, Acting Chairman, sir?

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:35.540
Thank you very much.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:38.450
What have I done to deserve it?

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.950
It's about Yuri.

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:44.120
You stood up for Yuri until the end.

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:47.290
Miss Moyu told me.

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:51.910
And yet I was not able to save her.

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:55.790
I'll do it.

00:15:55.790 --> 00:16:00.950
I don't want anyone else
to end up like Yuri did.

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:07.410
I don't want any more Lilies to
feel sad after losing friends, either.

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:12.120
It's quiet.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:15.620
We should be underwater by now.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:23.540
Is that the ultra-class Huge?

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:27.040
I'll accompany her on this mission.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.410
Yuyu.

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:32.580
What Riri just said is my wish, too.

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:37.160
As long as I care for you and you care for me,

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:40.080
we'll definitely come back.

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:44.790
I'll protect you, Riri.

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:48.410
Then I'll protect you, Yuyu.

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:51.290
Yuyu, Riri...

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:52.870
I'm sorry.

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:56.200
We always put you through such hardships.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.450
No.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:01.080
You all did your duty.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:08.330
We're depending on you.

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:27.290
I can feel Miss Misuzu from the CHARM.

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:29.040
Yes.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:21.620
Riri!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.290
Yuyu!

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:56.870
"Hitotsuyanagi Yuri"

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:58.830
"Hitotsuyanagi Yuri"

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:58.830
Riri, did I wake you up?

00:18:58.830 --> 00:18:59.370
Riri, did I wake you up?

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:01.750
Yuri...

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:04.040
Can't you sleep?

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:06.330
I don't know.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:10.330
I feel like I had a sad dream,

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:13.580
but I can't remember it now.

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:15.580
Don't worry.

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:21.910
I'll definitely get you and Yuyu
back to everyone else.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:26.200
Thank you, Riri.

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:29.540
Yuri...

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:36.950
Riri.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:40.250
Yuyu.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:41.620
Where...?

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:45.330
We defeated the ultra-class Huge.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:49.870
Now we're on our way back to everyone.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.450
It feels kind of like I'm wrapped up in you.

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:55.910
What do you mean?

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:08.120
Yuri... came to see me.

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.540
I see.

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:14.200
Miss Misuzu didn't visit me.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:21.910
Miss Misuzu must have really loved you, Yuyu.

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:28.000
Back then, she wanted to
protect you no matter what.

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:34.450
Her feelings were engraved deep,
deep into that Dáinsleif.

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:37.250
I could feel them, too.

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:43.870
Then Miss Misuzu didn't drive
the Huge berserk deliberately?

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:45.450
Right.

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:50.700
But I just can't understand it.

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:57.410
I mean, I think that if she
loved you, that's fine. Right?

00:20:57.410 --> 00:21:02.450
But Miss Misuzu couldn't
accept that part of herself.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:07.450
Still, I don't think she ever cursed herself.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:10.540
Just because of that?

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:12.870
It matters a lot.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:16.950
That's why I feel that way.

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.290
We've all been looking for you for ages!

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:37.830
I'm so glad you're both all right!

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:40.910
This will make a great article.

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:44.450
But you can't put them in
a newspaper looking like that.

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:46.500
Just when I finally found you!

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:50.160
There's a time and a place for these things!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:53.290
Th-Thank you, everyone.

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:56.200
Welcome back, you two.

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:58.120
Welcome home.

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:00.370
Welcome back.

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:04.290
Welcome back! Welcome home.

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:09.370
We're home.

00:22:19.660 --> 00:22:24.660
"Episode 12"

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:29.410
"Weekly Lily News"
"Miss Yuyu, Riri, welcome home"
"Yuigahama nest destroyed!"

00:22:30.370 --> 00:22:36.160
"Scoop! A new Schutzengel:
A shocking pledge"

00:23:47.410 --> 00:23:56.290
"The end"

00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:58.120
"Illustration: Hosoi Mieko"

00:23:58.120 --> 00:23:59.370
"Illustration: Hosoi Mieko"

00:23:58.120 --> 00:23:59.370
Ready, set...

00:23:59.370 --> 00:24:01.450
"Illustration: Hosoi Mieko"

00:23:59.370 --> 00:24:01.450
How do you do?!

00:24:01.450 --> 00:24:01.910
"Illustration: Hosoi Mieko"
